   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">WCF Pet &amp; Equestrian are launching a charity partnership with the Lake District Mountain Rescue Search Dog Association (LDMRSDA).&#xA;Derwent Water, Keswick.&#xA;Back row: L-R&#xA;Tom Woolley, holding his graded search dog Tess, Emma Atherton, Secretary and Trustee, (LDMRSDA), Lisa Evans, Dogs Body, (LDMRSDA), Rick Wilson, Dogs Body, (LDMRSDA), Gavin Grimsey, Equipment Officer, (LDMRSDA), Mick Guy, Treasurer, (LDMRSDA), &#xA;Front row left to right.&#xA;Mike Gullen, Team Leader (LDMRSDA), holding his graded search dog Marty, Scarlett Betts, Business Development Manager, WCF Pet &amp; Equestrian, Rob Grange, Chair (LDMRSDA), holding his graded search dog Broch, Jade Earley, General Manager, WCF Pet &amp; Equestrian, Mike Evans, Fundraising Officer (LDMRSDA), with his trainee search dog Fjell.&#xA;11th March 2025&#xA;Photograph Jonathan Becker&#xA;</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
   <dc:creator>
    <rdf:Seq>
     <rdf:li>Jonathan Becker</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Seq>
   </dc:creator>
